      <title>How Russia’s War Machine Traps Asian Workers</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-24/how-russia-s-war-machine-traps-asian-workers</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">db115ca875d5365f18bd17de</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:00:07 +0000</pubDate>
