      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-24/crowdstrike-zscaler-is-a-test-of-all-stock-deals</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f2046d0afa5f8a7ef990142d</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:59:11 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>There weren’t many tech stocks that missed Monday’s stunning rally in the wake of Jensen Huang’s reinstatement at the helm of chip designer Nvidia Corp. Recently listed Anthropic PBC was down for a second day, if only slightly. But Crowdstrike Holdings Inc. really had investors fretting following its deal to buy rival cybersecurity firm Zscaler Inc. for an enterprise value of $44 billion.</description>
